guide forever/horde/02-silverpine
title Silverpine Forest
faction Horde
levels 12-18
zone Silverpine Forest
next forever/horde/03-hillsbrad
pitch Undercity's backyard: a compact forest with the Forsaken's own story and short walks between quests.
pro Short walks from the Sepulcher
pro Ends in the Undercity: no zeppelin
pro Undead: 2 min faster to level 32
con No Hunter, Shaman or Druid trainer
con Skyborne: 22 min slower to level 32

# Route choice for Undead and Skyborne against forever/horde/02-barrens (the
# consensus route of the simulator, world 5b662c40, for both).
#
# Arrivals: Undead at about 11.7 from Brill, on foot down the road past the
# Undercity, after taking Delivery to Silverpine Forest (445) from Apothecary
# Johaan in Brill (the Tirisfal guide leaves it here, so Undead who choose the
# Barrens never carry it); Skyborne at about 14.6 from the airship landing in
# northern Mulgore, by Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.
#
# Built from the game's quest and map data and machine-checked (lint + the
# playthrough simulator); not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Flow: The Sepulcher (bind, flight path) -> east: Moonrage Whitescalps and
# bears -> north loop: Malden's Orchard, The Skittering Dark, The Ivar Patch,
# Erland's escort -> north loop 2: Moonrage shackles, The Dead Field, Ivar the
# Foul -> bat to the Undercity (training) -> east loop: The Decrepit Ferry,
# Grimson the Pale, the Dalaran crate -> south loop: Pyrewood Village, the
# refugees, Ambermill -> Fenris Isle and the Lordamere Lake shore -> bat to the
# Undercity, Brill and back: forever/horde/03-hillsbrad starts in the
# Apothecarium.
#
# Added in this revision (measured to the end of 03-hillsbrad, Undead /
# Skyborne): Watching the Roads (95981, -0.14 / -0.09 h), Stop the Spread
# (98299, -0.12 / -0.07 h) and Arugal's Folly (98298, -0.10 / -0.06 h).
#
# Optional: Arugal's Folly (99, the Pyrewood Shackles) and Pyrewood Ambush
# (452): the Pyrewood villagers and councilmen are elite, so grouping up is
# advised.
#
# Left out on purpose: The Weaver (480, Archmage Ataeric is level 22 inside
# Ambermill), Beren's Peril (516, Ravenclaw Drudgers and Guardians are 19-21),
# Thule Ravenclaw (446, sends you back from the Undercity to the Sepulcher) and
# Assault on Fenris Isle (442, level 24), A Husband's Revenge (530, level 20),
# Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills (493: minimum level 19, +2 h of waiting under
# the simulator), the rogue's Find the Shattered Hand (2378, Orgrimmar) and
# Fenwick Thatros (1998, Hillsbrad), and the Shadowfang Keep quests (1098,
# 1014: minimum level 18, the route is about 17 at the Sepulcher).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undead: Brill

step Apothecary Johaan
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Before you leave Brill, Apothecary Johaan has a delivery for the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.
  accept 445                          -- Apothecary Johaan

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skyborne: the way north

step Zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades
  only Skyborne
  zone Durotar
  tip From the airship landing in northern Mulgore, follow the Gold Road north-east into the Barrens and north past the Crossroads to Orgrimmar. The zeppelin tower stands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate; take the Undercity zeppelin.
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin tower"

step Into Silverpine
  only Skyborne
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The zeppelin lands at the towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Walk west along the road past the ruins and south into Silverpine Forest.
  goto 54.5,72.0 "Road to Silverpine"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Sepulcher

step The Sepulcher
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip The Sepulcher is the Forsaken crypt-town in the middle of the forest. Everyone you need stands around the crypt entrance.
  turnin 445 only Undead              -- Apothecary Renferrel
  accept 447
  accept 428                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 437
  accept 421                          -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  accept 6321 only Undead             -- Deathguard Podrig
  getfp "The Sepulcher" npc 2226      -- Karos Razok, the bat handler just east of the crypt
  turnin 6321 only Undead
  accept 6323 only Undead             -- Keep it: you fly to the Undercity at level 12
  sethome "The Sepulcher" npc 6739    -- Innkeeper Bates

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East, then north

step Moonrage Whitescalps
  tip The Moonrage worgen roam the woods just east of the Sepulcher. Kill every Grizzled Bear you see for their hearts; you need six for A Recipe For Death.
  goto 49.5,38.5 "East of the Sepulcher"
  kill 1769 quest 421.1
  collect 3253 quest 447.1 optional @48.5,32.0 -- Ferocious and Giant Grizzled Bears

step Dalar Dawnweaver
  turnin 421
  accept 422

step Malden's Orchard
  tip Head north. The Dusty Spellbooks lie in the farmhouse at Malden's Orchard.
  collect 3155 quest 422.1            -- Dusty Spellbooks
  collect 3253 quest 447.1 optional @52.0,21.0 -- Keep killing Grizzled Bears on the way

step The Skittering Dark
  tip Moss Stalkers crawl around the mouth of the cave at the north-west corner of the forest; Mist Creepers sit a little further north. Both drop Skittering Blood.
  goto 35.8,13.5 "The Skittering Dark"
  collect 3254 quest 447.2
  collect 3253 quest 447.1 optional @36.0,18.0 -- Giant Grizzled Bears roam the woods south of the cave

step Rane Yorick
  tip Follow the northern coast east to the Yoricks' house at The Ivar Patch.
  turnin 428                          -- Rane Yorick
  accept 429

step Worg hearts and Erland's escort
  tip Mottled Worgs prowl the hills around the house and the coast to the east; Worgs go further east. Deathstalker Erland waits north-east of the house: escort him back to Rane, and expect worgs to attack on the way.
  goto 55.0,15.0 "Hills east of the Yoricks' house"
  collect 3164 quest 429.1 @55.0,15.0 -- Mottled Worgs and Worgs
  accept 435                          -- Deathstalker Erland
  complete 435

step Rane Yorick
  turnin 435
  accept 449
  note Ivar the Foul (level 13) lurks a short walk west of the house, but Rane only sends you after him later. Leave him for the next trip north.

step Back to the Sepulcher
  tip Walk back south. Finish the bear hearts on the way if you still need them.
  collect 3253 quest 447.1 @48.5,32.0
  turnin 429                          -- Apothecary Renferrel
  accept 430
  turnin 449                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 3221
  turnin 3221                         -- Apothecary Renferrel
  accept 1359
  turnin 422                          -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  accept 423
  accept 477                          -- Shadow Priest Allister

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North again

step Moonrage shackles
  tip Moonrage Darksouls and Gluttons share the woods north and north-west of the Sepulcher, up toward the Dead Field.
  goto 43.0,31.0 "North of the Sepulcher"
  collect 3157 quest 423.2            -- Moonrage Darksouls
  collect 3156 quest 423.1 @41.0,25.5 -- Moonrage Gluttons

step The Dead Field
  tip Nightlash (level 14) haunts the Dead Field. Kill it, then walk across the field to investigate it.
  collect 3622 quest 437.1
  complete 437 @45.1,21.7

step The Ivar Patch
  turnin 430                          -- Quinn Yorick, in the Yoricks' house
  accept 425                          -- Rane Yorick
  collect 3621 quest 425              -- Ivar the Foul, a short walk west of the house
  turnin 425

step Back to the Sepulcher
  turnin 423                          -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  accept 424
  turnin 437                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 438
  level 12                            -- Short? Moonrage worgen roam just east and north of the Sepulcher

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity, level 12+

step Fly to the Undercity
  fly "Undercity"                     -- Karos Razok

step Undercity
  zone map 1458
  tip The bat drops you beside Michael Garrett in the Trade Quarter, the middle ring of the city. The Apothecarium is south-west of it, the War Quarter north-west, the Magic Quarter north-east and the Rogues' Quarter south-east.
  turnin 6323 only Undead             -- Gordon Wendham, Trade Quarter
  accept 6322 only Undead
  turnin 6322 only Undead             -- Michael Garrett, the bat handler
  accept 6324 only Undead
  turnin 447                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Apothecarium
  accept 450
  turnin 1359                         -- Apothecary Zinge, in the Apothecarium
  accept 1358
  note Keep Sample for Helbrim: you hand it in at the Crossroads in the Barrens, after Hillsbrad (forever/horde/04-barrens).
  train 4593 only Warrior             -- Christoph Walker, War Quarter
  train 4607 only Priest              -- Father Lankester, War Quarter
  train 4566 only Mage                -- Kaelystia Hatebringer, Magic Quarter
  train 4563 only Warlock             -- Kaal Soulreaper, Magic Quarter
  train 4583 only Rogue               -- Miles Dexter, Rogues' Quarter
  accept 1886 only Rogue,Undead       -- Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter
  note Hunters, Shamans and Druids: no trainer for you here; you train in Orgrimmar at the end of this guide.

step Back to the Sepulcher
  zone Silverpine Forest
  fly "The Sepulcher"                 -- Michael Garrett
  turnin 6324 only Undead             -- Deathguard Podrig
  turnin 450                          -- Apothecary Renferrel
  accept 451
  note Renferrel's lake moss and murloc tumor are for later, at Lordamere Lake.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East loop

step Astor Hadren
  only Rogue,Undead
  tip Astor Hadren (level 13) stands north-east of the Sepulcher, on your way to the lake. Kill him for the letter.
  collect 7231 quest 1886

step The Decrepit Ferry
  tip The Corpse Laden Boat lies at the ferry landing on the lake shore east of the Sepulcher.
  turnin 438
  accept 439

step Grimson the Pale
  tip Grimson the Pale (level 15) stands south of the ferry.
  collect 3634 quest 424.1

step Border Crossings
  tip The Dalaran Crate sits south-west of Grimson, beside the road south.
  turnin 477
  accept 478

step Back to the Sepulcher
  turnin 424                          -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  accept 99 optional
  turnin 439                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 440
  accept 443
  turnin 478                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 481
  turnin 481                          -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  accept 98298
  accept 98299
  accept 482
  turnin 482                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 479
  accept 95981
  note Keep The Engraved Ring for Magistrate Sevren in Brill: you pass Brill on your way out of the zone.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South loop

step Pyrewood Village
  tip Follow the road south to Pyrewood Village. The villagers are worgen in disguise; Watchers, Sentries and Elders all drop Pyrewood Shackles. Berard's Bookshelf is in a house on the west side of the village. The Pyrewood villagers and the councilmen of Pyrewood Ambush are elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 45.0,73.0 "Pyrewood Village"
  collect 3218 quest 99.1 optional
  collect 3255 quest 450 optional     -- Already handed in? Ignore this
  accept 452 optional                 -- Deathstalker Faerleia, on the east side of the village
  complete 452 optional               -- Stay by her: the villagers come in waves
  turnin 452 optional

step South of Pyrewood
  tip The Sickly and Haggard Refugees shamble along the road south of Pyrewood toward the Greymane Wall. Moonrage Bloodhowlers prowl the woods between Pyrewood and Ambermill; they drop the Worgen Bits.
  goto 46.0,85.0 "Refugees"
  kill 2054 quest 98299.1
  kill 2053 quest 98299.2
  collect 280375 quest 98298.1

step Ambermill
  tip The Dalaran wizards hold Ambermill, east of Pyrewood. Protectors guard the outskirts, Mages the town itself; both drop pendants. Wizards and Watchers patrol around the town. Stay out of the middle, where Archmage Ataeric (level 22) stands.
  goto 59.0,63.0 "Ambermill"
  collect 3354 quest 479.1
  kill 1889 quest 95981.1
  kill 1888 quest 95981.2

step Hearth to the Sepulcher
  hearth "The Sepulcher"              -- Hearthstone on cooldown? Follow the road north.

step The Sepulcher
  turnin 99 optional                  -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  turnin 98298
  turnin 98299
  turnin 479                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  turnin 95981
  note Allister now offers The Weaver: Archmage Ataeric is level 22 in the middle of Ambermill. Skip it.
  level 15                            -- Short? The Moonrage Darksouls north of the Sepulcher are good experience

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fenris Isle and Lordamere Lake

step Fenris Isle
  tip Swim out to Fenris Isle in Lordamere Lake, east of the Decrepit Ferry. Rot Hide gnolls cover the island; every type drops Rot Hide Ichor. Stay out of Fenris Keep on the north side of the island: the gnolls there are level 18-22 and Thule Ravenclaw (24) stands inside.
  goto 67.5,30.0 "Fenris Isle"
  collect 3236 quest 443
  accept 460 optional                 -- Only if A Talking Head dropped from a gnoll
  turnin 460 optional                 -- Shallow Grave, just east of the keep
  accept 461 optional
  turnin 461 optional                 -- Dusty Shelf, inside the keep: bring a friend or skip it
  accept 491 optional

step Lordamere Lake shore
  tip Lake Skulkers sit along the shore south-east of the island, Lake Creepers and Elder Lake Creepers further north-east. The Hardened Tumor is a rare drop from any Vile Fin murloc around the lake.
  goto 72.5,35.5 "Lake Skulkers"
  collect 3256 quest 451.2
  collect 3257 quest 451.1 @76.5,24.5 -- Lake Creepers
  collect 3258 quest 451.3 @68.5,21.0 -- Vile Fin Lakestalkers and Oracles
  level 17                            -- Short? Keep killing Rot Hides and lake creatures; the next guide expects 17

step Back to the Sepulcher
  turnin 443                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 444

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Brill and the Undercity

step Brill
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  fly "Undercity"                     -- Karos Razok
  tip From the Undercity, follow the road north to Brill.
  turnin 440                          -- Magistrate Sevren, in the town hall
  accept 441

step Undercity
  zone map 1458
  turnin 441                          -- Raleigh Andrean, Trade Quarter
  turnin 451                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Apothecarium
  turnin 444                          -- Bethor Iceshard, Magic Quarter
  turnin 491 optional
  note Bethor's next task, Thule Ravenclaw, sends you back to the Sepulcher. Skip it.

step The Deathstalkers
  only Rogue,Undead
  zone map 1458
  turnin 1886                         -- Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter
  accept 1898
  turnin 1898                         -- Andron Gant
  accept 1899
  collect 7294 quest 1899             -- Andron's Bookshelf, next to him
  turnin 1899                         -- Mennet Carkad
  accept 1978
  turnin 1978                         -- Varimathras, beside Lady Sylvanas in the Royal Quarter
  note The next guide starts right here, in the Apothecarium.
